---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Pilot Training & Checkride Study Tools | PilotDesk" description="Choose written practice, oral and checkride prep, or a certificate study path. Find your next step with PilotDesk Learn." canonical="/flight-training.html" bodyClass="pd-learn-page" schema={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'CollectionPage',name:'PilotDesk Flight Training',url:'https://www.pilot-desk.com/flight-training.html'}}>
<Fragment slot="head"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/learn-hub.css"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/training-progress.css"/></Fragment>
<div data-learn-hub>
<nav class="learn-jump" aria-label="On this learning page"><a href="#written">Written prep</a><a href="#oral">Oral &amp; checkride</a><a href="#ratings">Study by rating</a><a href="#pdTrainingProgress">Your study goal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
<section class="learn-journey" id="learn-journey" aria-labelledby="learn-title"><div class="learn-story"><header class="learn-intro"><p class="learn-kicker">PILOTDESK / LEARN</p><h1 id="learn-title">Know it. Explain it.<br><em>Fly with it.</em></h1><p class="learn-intro-copy">Your practice, your rating, and your next step. All in one place.</p><div class="learn-return" id="learn-return" hidden><a id="learn-continue" href="/flight-training.html">Continue studying <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a><span id="learn-continue-context"></span></div><p class="learn-availability">Free written prep &amp; references. Pro adds fuller oral practice.</p></header></div><aside class="learn-visual" aria-label="Animated flight-study notebook"><div class="learn-stage"><img class="learn-scene-poster" src="/assets/learn-scenes/notebook-topics-poster.webp" alt="An open flight-study notebook showing aviation study topics." width="1000" height="900"><div id="learn-scene-root" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="learn-scene-label" aria-hidden="true"><span>THE STUDY DESK</span><span>READ · EXPLAIN · APPLY</span></div></div></aside></section>
<section class="learn-study-options" data-sc-act="flow" aria-label="Choose your practice">  <section class="learn-track" data-sc-in="" id="written" aria-labelledby="written-title"><div class="learn-track-head"><h2 id="written-title">Written prep</h2><span class="learn-access">Free</span></div><p>Practice questions, understand the explanation, and revisit weak subjects.</p><a class="learn-primary" href="/written-prep.html">Start written practice <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="learn-secondary" href="/skill-gap.html">Review your weak subjects →</a></section>
  <section class="learn-track" data-sc-in="" id="oral" aria-labelledby="oral-title"><div class="learn-track-head"><h2 id="oral-title">Oral &amp; checkride</h2><span class="learn-access">Free preview + Pro</span></div><p>Practice explaining your decisions and answering the follow-up.</p><a class="learn-primary" href="/learn/oral-exam/">Open oral prep <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="learn-related"><a href="/learn/checkride-lab/">Checkride Lab <small>PRO</small> →</a><a href="/learn/study-plan/">Build a study plan <small>PRO</small> →</a></div></section>
</section>
<div class="learn-lower-grid"><section class="learn-paths" id="ratings" aria-labelledby="ratings-title"><div class="learn-section-intro"><h2 id="ratings-title">Study by rating</h2><p>Subjects, references, and practice for your next certificate.</p></div><div class="pd-training-ratings learn-rating-list"><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/private-pilot.html"><span>01</span><h3>Private Pilot</h3><p>Fundamentals &amp; flight decisions</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/instrument-rating.html"><span>02</span><h3>Instrument Rating</h3><p>IFR procedures &amp; planning</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/commercial-pilot.html"><span>03</span><h3>Commercial Pilot</h3><p>Performance &amp; judgment</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/multiengine.html"><span>04</span><h3>Multi-Engine</h3><p>Systems &amp; engine-out</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/cfi.html"><span>05</span><h3>CFI</h3><p>Teaching &amp; assessment</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/cfii.html"><span>06</span><h3>CFII</h3><p>Instrument instruction</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a class="learn-rating" href="/training/atp.html"><span>07</span><h3>ATP</h3><p>Advanced operations</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></section>
<div class="learn-goal"><section class="pd-training-progress pd-certificate-selector" id="pdTrainingProgress" aria-labelledby="pdTrainingProgressTitle"><div class="learn-goal-heading"><div><h2 id="pdTrainingProgressTitle">Your study goal</h2><p>Save your rating and target date on this device.</p></div><div class="pd-training-countdown" id="pdTrainingCountdown" hidden=""><strong id="pdTrainingDays">—</strong><span>days to target</span></div></div><div class="pd-training-progress-controls"><label>Current goal<select id="pdTrainingGoalLocal"><option value="">Choose a rating</option><option value="ppl">Private Pilot</option><option value="ira">Instrument Rating</option><option value="cpl">Commercial Pilot</option><option value="multi">Multi-Engine</option><option value="cfi">CFI</option><option value="cfii">CFII</option><option value="atp">ATP</option></select></label><label>Target / checkride date<input type="date" id="pdTrainingDateLocal"></label><button class="pd-btn" type="button" id="pdTrainingSaveLocal">Save study goal</button></div><div class="pd-training-next" id="pdTrainingNext" hidden=""><div><small>CURRENT FOCUS</small><b id="pdTrainingNextTitle"></b><span id="pdTrainingNextCopy"></span></div><div class="pd-actions"><a class="pd-btn secondary" id="pdTrainingRatingLink" href="/flight-training.html">Open rating guide</a><a id="pdTrainingWrittenLink" href="/written-prep.html">Written prep →</a><a id="pdTrainingOralLink" href="/learn/checkride-lab/">Mock oral · Pro →</a><a id="pdTrainingPlanLink" href="/learn/study-plan/">Study plan · Pro →</a></div></div><p class="fine">Signed-in pilots can also save this goal from the Account page so it follows the account.</p></section>
<p id="learn-goal-feedback" role="status"></p></div></div><section class="learn-reference" aria-labelledby="learn-reference-title"><details><summary><h2 id="learn-reference-title">Resources &amp; references</h2><span>FAA standards · checklists · instructor tools</span></summary><div class="learn-reference-links"><a href="/training/acs-far-reference.html">FAA standards &amp; rules <span>↗</span></a><a href="/learn/coverage/">Topics by FAA standard <span>↗</span></a><a href="/checklist-trainer.html">Checklist practice <span>↗</span></a><a href="/for-cfis.html">For instructors <span>↗</span></a><a href="/preflight-brief.html">Preflight scenarios <small>PRO</small><span>↗</span></a></div></details><p>PilotDesk supports your study. Check current FAA standards, regulations, handbooks, and the aircraft POH/AFM.</p></section>
</div>
<Fragment slot="scripts"><script is:inline defer src="/assets/learn-scrollcraft.js"></script><script is:inline defer src="/assets/training-progress.js"></script><script>import '../scripts/learn-entry.jsx';</script></Fragment>
</BaseLayout>
